							<sr7-txt id="SR7_2_1-2STR1-1" class="sr7-layer">Global Read Kick-Off</sr7-txt>
							<sr7-txt id="SR7_2_1-2STR1-2" class="sr7-layer">December 3, 11:30 a.m. - 1:15 p.m.</sr7-txt>
							<sr7-txt id="SR7_2_1-2STR1-3" class="sr7-layer">Featuring Solito by Javier Zamora. Discover shared humanity through storytelling, Salvadoran food and refreshments.</sr7-txt>
							<a id="SR7_2_1-2STR1-4" class="sr7-layer" href="/event/global-read-kick-off-solito-a-memoir-by-javier-zamora/" target="_self">Learn More</a>
