							<sr7-txt id="SR7_2_1-2STR2-3" class="sr7-layer">Stigma-Free Event, lunch will be served.</sr7-txt>
							<a id="SR7_2_1-2STR2-4" class="sr7-layer" href="https://www.brookdalecc.edu/event/stigma-free-event/" target="_self">Learn More</a>
