							<sr7-txt id="SR7_2_1-2STR3-3" class="sr7-layer">Appointments encouraged. Walk-Ins Welcome. Student Life Center, Navesink Rooms.</sr7-txt>
							<a id="SR7_2_1-2STR3-4" class="sr7-layer" href="https://www.brookdalecc.edu/event/student-nurse-association-blood-drive/#new_tab" target="_self">Learn More</a>
